cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying article
  (preferred-citation below) and the archived software release.
title: "Schema-Driven Interfaces: Angio-GUI and V-Cornea GUI"
abstract: >-
  Schema-driven graphical interfaces, provenance capture and COMBINE/OMEX run
  archives for two CompuCell3D models exposed as Vivarium processes:
  Angio-GUI (integrated, API-driven pattern) and the V-Cornea GUI (decoupled,
  subprocess-based pattern).
type: software
license: MIT
